{"seq":2,"slug":"detention-demurrage-fee-calculation","title":"滞期费与滞留费计算规则及承运商结算","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/yard-management-system-dock-door-trailer-appointment/performance-detention-exception-ops/detention-demurrage-fee-calculation","wordCount":2746,"readingTime":11,"html":"<h1 id=\"滞期费与滞留费计算规则及承运商结算\">滞期费与滞留费计算规则及承运商结算</h1><p>集装箱在洛杉矶港免费堆存到第 5 天上午 11:00 被提走，超期 6 小时；同一票货的箱子在客户仓库卸完后压了 9 天才还空箱。这两笔钱的算法完全不同——前者叫 <strong>Demurrage（滞期费）</strong>，时钟在码头里走；后者叫 <strong>Detention（滞留费）</strong>，时钟在码头外走。把它们塞进一个「超期天数 × 单价」的字段，是结算对账出错最常见的原因。</p>\n<p>本文讨论计费规则的建模、费率分段与承运商结算流程。里程、免费时长、费率档位不依赖任何特定园区配置即可读懂。判定所依赖的原始事件（入闸、出闸、月台占用起止）来自 <a href=\"../gate-event-wms-tms-integration/gate-checkin-checkout-event-model\">门禁事件成对记录模型</a>；承运商侧的偏离与信用机制见 <a href=\"../appointment-scheduling-dock-scheduling/appointment-lifecycle-reschedule-noshow\">预约生命周期</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-两个时钟-两类责任方\">核心概念：两个时钟、两类责任方</h2><p>行业惯例把「超期用箱」分成两种，判据是<strong>集装箱的物理位置</strong>与<strong>责任方</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Demurrage（滞期费）</strong>：箱子仍在码头/堆场内，超过承运人给的免费堆存期（free time）。责任通常落在<strong>收货人/进口商</strong>，因为提货动作归他。</li>\n<li><strong>Detention（滞留费）</strong>：箱子已离开码头（被提走），超过约定的免费占用期仍未归还空箱。责任同样多在<strong>收货人</strong>，但若涉及拖车队保管，则在合同里另行划分。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>两者的免费时长基准不同：Demurrage 的免费期常见为 <strong>3–7 个日历日</strong>（港口、箱型、承运人、合约条款而异），Detention 通常更短，约 <strong>3–5 天</strong>。美国联邦海事委员会（FMC）在《2022 年海运改革法案》（OSRA）授权下修订了 <strong>46 CFR Part 541</strong>「Demurrage and Detention Billing Requirements」，该最终规则自 <strong>2024 年 5 月 26 日</strong>生效（来源：FMC，46 CFR Part 541 最终规则，<a href=\"https://www.fmc.gov），把「谁可开票、何时必须开票、发票必须包含什么」写成了强约束。\">https://www.fmc.gov），把「谁可开票、何时必须开票、发票必须包含什么」写成了强约束。</a></p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[Container 卸船 Discharge] --&gt; B{在码头内 In Terminal}&#10;  B --&gt;|免费堆存期内| C[Demurrage Free Time 计时]&#10;  C --&gt;|超期| D[Demurrage 计费&lt;br/&gt;按日历日阶梯费率]&#10;  B --&gt;|提货 Gate-Out| E{在码头外 In Shipper Custody}&#10;  E --&gt;|免费占用期内| F[Detention Free Time 计时]&#10;  F --&gt;|超期未还空箱| G[Detention 计费&lt;br/&gt;按日历日阶梯费率]&#10;  D --&gt; H[Carrier Invoice 承运人开票]&#10;  G --&gt; H&#10;  H --&gt; I{争议期内申诉?}&#10;  I --&gt;|争议成立| J[Reversal / 减免]&#10;  I --&gt;|无争议| K[Settlement 对账核销]&#10;  J --&gt; K\">flowchart TD\n  A[Container 卸船 Discharge] --&gt; B{在码头内 In Terminal}\n  B --&gt;|免费堆存期内| C[Demurrage Free Time 计时]\n  C --&gt;|超期| D[Demurrage 计费&lt;br/&gt;按日历日阶梯费率]\n  B --&gt;|提货 Gate-Out| E{在码头外 In Shipper Custody}\n  E --&gt;|免费占用期内| F[Detention Free Time 计时]\n  F --&gt;|超期未还空箱| G[Detention 计费&lt;br/&gt;按日历日阶梯费率]\n  D --&gt; H[Carrier Invoice 承运人开票]\n  G --&gt; H\n  H --&gt; I{争议期内申诉?}\n  I --&gt;|争议成立| J[Reversal / 减免]\n  I --&gt;|无争议| K[Settlement 对账核销]\n  J --&gt; K</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>Demurrage 滞期费</th>\n<th>Detention 滞留费</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>起算点</td>\n<td>卸船 / 可用日（Availability）</td>\n<td>出闸 Gate-Out</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>计时位置</td>\n<td>码头、堆场内</td>\n<td>码头外（收货人/车队保管）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>终止点</td>\n<td>提货车出闸 Gate-Out</td>\n<td>空箱回闸 Empty Return</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>免费时长典型值</td>\n<td>3–7 日历日</td>\n<td>3–5 日历日</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>责任方</td>\n<td>收货人/进口商</td>\n<td>收货人，拖车分包含同约定</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>计费粒度</td>\n<td>日历日，跨日进位</td>\n<td>日历日，跨日进位</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"免费时长与起止时钟的精确界定\">免费时长与起止时钟的精确界定</h2><p>免费时长不是「一个数字」，而是<strong>一个区间 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mi>t</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">_</mi><mtext>start</mtext><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi>t</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">_</mi><mtext>end</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">[t\\_{\\text{start}},\\, t\\_{\\text{end}})</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.06em;vertical-align:-0.31em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mord\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">_</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">start</span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mord\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">_</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">end</span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></strong>，端点定义错误比费率错误更常引发争议。</p>\n<p>起算点有两个流派：<strong>卸船日（discharge date）</strong> 或 <strong>可提货日（availability date）</strong>。FMC 规则要求承运人须在发票中列明免费期的计算依据，因为二者在拥堵港口可能相差数日——船到但码头未完成拆箱或未放行，按卸船日起算会让收货人白白承担码头自身的延误。工程上应把两个时间都落库，并按合同条款选择其一作为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mtext>start</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t_{\\text{start}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7651em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">start</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>。</p>\n<p>终止点是<strong>物理事件时间戳</strong>，而非请求或通知时间：Demurrage 止于提货车实际出闸的 <code>gate_out_at</code>；Detention 止于空箱实际回闸的 <code>empty_return_at</code>。把「预约还箱时段」当成终止点，会在车未按时到场时系统性少计。</p>\n<p>免费期按日历日推进，因此<strong>进位规则</strong>决定了边界案例的钱：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>D</mi><mtext>charge</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mtext> ⁣</mtext><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext>  </mtext><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.2em\" maxsize=\"1.2em\">⌈</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mtext>out</mtext></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mtext>end</mtext></msub><msub><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.2em\" maxsize=\"1.2em\">⌉</mo><mtext>day</mtext></msub><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">D_{\\text{charge}} = \\max\\!\\left(0,\\; \\big\\lceil t_{\\text{out}} - t_{\\text{end}} \\big\\rceil_{\\text{day}}\\right)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">charge</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.8em;vertical-align:-0.65em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">max</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:-0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size2\">(</span></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">⌈</span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">out</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">end</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">⌉</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.0864em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.3003em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">day</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.5358em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size2\">)</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">⌈</mo><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">⌉</mo><mtext>day</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\lceil\\cdot\\rceil_{\\text{day}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0361em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">⌈</span><span class=\"mord\">⋅</span><span class=\"mclose\"><span class=\"mclose\">⌉</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">day</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 表示不足一整个日历日按一日计。常见的三种粒度实现差异极大：<strong>按自然日跨零点进位</strong>（超期 1 分钟即算一天）、<strong>按 24 小时滚动进位</strong>、<strong>按小时计费</strong>。选择必须写进合同并在系统中固化为一个可配置枚举，绝不能在代码里散落成魔法分支。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;  S[t_start 起算] --&gt; FT[Free Time 免费期]&#10;  FT --&gt; E[t_end 免费终止]&#10;  E --&gt;|超期| Tier1[费率档 1&lt;br/&gt;第 1-5 日]&#10;  Tier1 --&gt; Tier2[费率档 2&lt;br/&gt;第 6-10 日]&#10;  Tier2 --&gt; Tier3[费率档 3&lt;br/&gt;第 11 日起]&#10;  Tier3 --&gt; CAP[封顶 / 上限条款]\">flowchart LR\n  S[t_start 起算] --&gt; FT[Free Time 免费期]\n  FT --&gt; E[t_end 免费终止]\n  E --&gt;|超期| Tier1[费率档 1&lt;br/&gt;第 1-5 日]\n  Tier1 --&gt; Tier2[费率档 2&lt;br/&gt;第 6-10 日]\n  Tier2 --&gt; Tier3[费率档 3&lt;br/&gt;第 11 日起]\n  Tier3 --&gt; CAP[封顶 / 上限条款]</pre><h2 id=\"计费引擎-费率阶梯-日历时钟与量化误差\">计费引擎：费率阶梯、日历时钟与量化误差</h2><p>统一计费公式把「档位单价」与「该档天数」做加权求和。设超期天数为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>D</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">D</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span></span></span></span></span>，第 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">d</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span></span></span></span></span> 天的适用单价为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>r</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>d</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r(d)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>（阶梯函数），则</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>F</mi><mtext>total</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><munderover><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>d</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>D</mi></munderover><mi>r</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>d</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>⋅</mo><mn mathvariant=\"double-struck\">1</mn><mtext> ⁣</mtext><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">[</mo><mi>d</mi><mo>≤</mo><mi>D</mi><mo fence=\"true\">]</mo></mrow><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"/><mi>r</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>d</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>r</mi><mi>k</mi></msub><mtext>  </mtext><mtext>当</mtext><mtext>  </mtext><mi>d</mi><mo>∈</mo><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.2em\" maxsize=\"1.2em\">(</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mi>k</mi></msub><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.2em\" maxsize=\"1.2em\">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">F_{\\text{total}} = \\sum_{d=1}^{D} r(d)\\cdot \\mathbb{1}\\!\\left[d \\le D\\right], \\qquad r(d)= r_k \\;\\text{当}\\; d \\in \\big(T_{k-1}, T_k\\big]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">total</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:3.1304em;vertical-align:-1.3021em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.8283em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8479em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">=</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.3em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3021em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:-0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">[</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">]</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:2em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">当</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2em;vertical-align:-0.35em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">(</span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2083em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">]</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>&lt;</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>&lt;</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>&lt;</mo><mo>…</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_0=0 &lt; T_1 &lt; T_2 &lt; \\dots</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6835em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.123em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\">…</span></span></span></span></span> 是档位分界。现实费率是<strong>递增阶梯</strong>：许多承运人与码头对同一箱型的前 5 天给一个基础 per-diem（如每箱每日 100–200 美元区间，随承运人与箱型浮动），之后逐档上抬，用以加速还箱。若合同带封顶，则</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>F</mi><mtext>billed</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>min</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mtext> ⁣</mtext><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><msub><mi>F</mi><mtext>total</mtext></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext>  </mtext><mtext>cap</mtext><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">F_{\\text{billed}} = \\min\\!\\left(F_{\\text{total}},\\; \\text{cap}\\right)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">billed</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">min</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:-0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">total</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">cap</span></span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">)</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>三个工程要点决定了这套算法能否在生产中站住：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>时钟来源必须唯一且可辩护。</strong> 计费不得使用本地时区猜测的「服务端当前时间」，而应使用事件时间戳（闸口 EDI 报文、码头 TOS 记录、GPS 到场）。时间的获取与注入应在边界完成，核心计费逻辑只接收已确定的时间值。</li>\n<li><strong>天数量化误差要对账可见。</strong> 引入与终止的分钟级抖动会跨越零点造成整日差，因此需保留<strong>原始时间戳</strong>与<strong>计算结果</strong>两级，任何一天差异都能回溯到具体的时间戳对。</li>\n<li><strong>费率表必须版本化且对已发生事件冻结。</strong> 计费基准日用事件发生时生效的费率版本，而非开票日的最新版本——否则一次费率调整会追溯改变已完成的作业。</li>\n</ol>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  E[Event Store 事件流] --&gt; X[Extract 提取起止时间戳]&#10;  X --&gt; Q[Quantize 天数量化]&#10;  Q --&gt; R[Rate Resolve 按基准日选费率版本]&#10;  R --&gt; C[Compute 阶梯求和与封顶]&#10;  C --&gt; I[Invoice Draft 发票草案]&#10;  I --&gt; D[Dispute Check 争议语义核对]&#10;  D --&gt; S[Settlement 结算核销]\">graph TD\n  E[Event Store 事件流] --&gt; X[Extract 提取起止时间戳]\n  X --&gt; Q[Quantize 天数量化]\n  Q --&gt; R[Rate Resolve 按基准日选费率版本]\n  R --&gt; C[Compute 阶梯求和与封顶]\n  C --&gt; I[Invoice Draft 发票草案]\n  I --&gt; D[Dispute Check 争议语义核对]\n  D --&gt; S[Settlement 结算核销]</pre><h2 id=\"承运商结算-对账-争议与发票合规\">承运商结算：对账、争议与发票合规</h2><p>计费结果是<strong>应收项</strong>，结算才是<strong>资金与责任落地</strong>。这条链路在监管下有三个硬约束，直接来自 FMC 的 46 CFR Part 541：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>开票主体限制</strong>：规则限定可由承运人向<strong>有合同关系的当事方</strong>（billed party，通常是有提单关系的货主）开票，禁止向与其无直接合同关系的一方转嫁 D&amp;D 费用。</li>\n<li><strong>开票时限</strong>：发票须在费用发生后 <strong>30 个日历日内</strong>签发，逾期即丧失收取资格。</li>\n<li><strong>争议窗口</strong>：被开票方有 <strong>30 个日历日</strong>提出争议，承运人须在同样 <strong>30 个日历日</strong>内予以解决。争议期内不得以不缴费为由施加额外压力。</li>\n<li><strong>发票要素</strong>：须包含提单号、集装箱号、卸货港、免费期起止、费率、计费起止时间等（规则列明的强制字段集合，来源：FMC 46 CFR Part 541，<a href=\"https://www.fmc.gov）。\">https://www.fmc.gov）。</a></li>\n</ul>\n<p>因此结算系统的字段设计不是财务自由发挥，而是<strong>合规驱动的 schema</strong>。少了「免费期依据」或「计费起止时间戳」，发票即不合规，承运人可据此抗辩。</p>\n<p>对账采用逐笔三向匹配：<strong>承运人发票行 ↔ 本地计费引擎行 ↔ 原始事件时间戳</strong>。三者一致才核销；任一不符则进入争议或挂账。跨境场景还需注意：FMC 规则仅管辖美国进出口的海运 D&amp;D；其他法域并无完全对应的强制规则，欧盟、东南亚的争议多走港口规则与商业合同，因此系统应以<strong>法域字段</strong>驱动不同的开票与申诉模板，而非全局套用一套。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>结算阶段</th>\n<th>关键动作</th>\n<th>失败后果</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>发票接收</td>\n<td>校验强制字段、开票时限</td>\n<td>不合规发票入账后被驳回</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>三向对账</td>\n<td>发票行 = 引擎行 = 事件戳</td>\n<td>多付或少收，无法举证</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>争议发起</td>\n<td>关联证据、计时 30 日</td>\n<td>逾期失去申诉权</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>争议解决</td>\n<td>承运人 30 日内裁定</td>\n<td>挂账僵持，影响信用额度</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>核销入账</td>\n<td>生成会计凭证、更新承运商台账</td>\n<td>池子对不上，后续计费基线漂移</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"异常与豁免-把责任归因写进规则\">异常与豁免：把责任归因写进规则</h2><p>一笔 D&amp;D 费用是否成立，本质是<strong>责任归因</strong>问题。以下情形在结算时应能自动识别为减免或豁免候选，而不是等承运商申诉才逐笔挑：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>码头/园区侧原因</strong>：港区关闭、码头系统宕机、月台门故障、装卸班组未就位导致无法提货或还箱。</li>\n<li><strong>承运人侧原因</strong>：空箱回流点饱和、指定还箱点变更未通知、底盘车（chassis）短缺。</li>\n<li><strong>不可抗力与监管</strong>：恶劣天气封港、海关查验（查扣期通常应从免费期中剔除）。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>系统的解法是<strong>引入「豁免时钟」</strong>：在免费期区间上做<strong>区间减法</strong>。设不可归因于收货人的时间窗集合为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"script\">X</mi><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">{</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>a</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>b</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">}</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathcal{X} = \\{(a_i, b_i)\\}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathcal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1464em;\">X</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">{(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)}</span></span></span></span></span>，则有效计费时长</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>D</mi><mtext>charge</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mtext> ⁣</mtext><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext>  </mtext><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.2em\" maxsize=\"1.2em\">⌈</mo><mtext> </mtext><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.2em\" maxsize=\"1.2em\">∣</mo><mtext> </mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mtext>start</mtext></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mtext>out</mtext></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo><mo>∖</mo><mi mathvariant=\"script\">X</mi><mtext> </mtext><msub><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.2em\" maxsize=\"1.2em\">∣</mo><mtext>day</mtext></msub><mtext> </mtext><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.2em\" maxsize=\"1.2em\">⌉</mo><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">D_{\\text{charge}} = \\max\\!\\left(0,\\; \\big\\lceil\\, \\big|\\,[t_{\\text{start}},t_{\\text{out}}] \\setminus \\mathcal{X}\\,\\big|_{\\text{day}} \\,\\big\\rceil\\right)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">charge</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.8em;vertical-align:-0.65em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">max</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:-0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size2\">(</span></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">⌈</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"delimsizing mult\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.85em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.85em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.2em;\"></span><span style=\"width:0.333em;height:1.2em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"0.333em\" height=\"1.2em\" viewBox=\"0 0 333 1200\"><path d=\"M145 15 v585 v0 v585 c2.667,10,9.667,15,21,15\nc10,0,16.667,-5,20,-15 v-585 v0 v-585 c-2.667,-10,-9.667,-15,-21,-15\nc-10,0,-16.667,5,-20,15z M188 15 H145 v585 v0 v585 h43z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.35em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">start</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">out</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">∖</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathcal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1464em;\">X</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"delimsizing mult\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.85em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.85em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.2em;\"></span><span style=\"width:0.333em;height:1.2em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"0.333em\" height=\"1.2em\" viewBox=\"0 0 333 1200\"><path d=\"M145 15 v585 v0 v585 c2.667,10,9.667,15,21,15\nc10,0,16.667,-5,20,-15 v-585 v0 v-585 c-2.667,-10,-9.667,-15,-21,-15\nc-10,0,-16.667,5,-20,15z M188 15 H145 v585 v0 v585 h43z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.35em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.0864em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.3003em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">day</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.5358em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">⌉</span></span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size2\">)</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>把豁免做成<strong>区间对象的集合差</strong>，而非一个布尔标志，才能处理重叠的豁免窗口（如封港期与查验期交叠）且不重复扣减。每段豁免必须带<strong>证据引用</strong>（关闭公告、系统日志、查验单号），否则减免本身就成了不可审计的操作。</p>\n<p>争议面板的判定还应遵循 FMC 规则里关于「incentive principle」的取向：D&amp;D 的正当目的是促进货物流动、激励及时提还箱，而非创收。当争议的根因是承运人或码头自身造成的障碍时，费用倾向于不成立——这一点在争议自动裁决的规则里应作为默认偏置。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>两个时钟</strong>：Demurrage 在码头内（止于出闸），Detention 在码头外（止于空箱回闸），责任方与计费粒度都必须分开建模。</li>\n<li><strong>免费时长是区间不是数字</strong>：起算点（卸船日 vs 可提货日）与终止点（物理事件时间戳）界定错误比费率错误更常见；进位粒度须固化为可配置枚举。</li>\n<li><strong>计费 = 阶梯求和 + 封顶</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>F</mi><mtext>total</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mo>∑</mo><mi>d</mi></msub><mi>r</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>d</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">F_{\\text{total}}=\\sum_d r(d)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">total</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0497em;vertical-align:-0.2997em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1864em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4003em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2997em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，费率表版本化并对已发生事件冻结；保留原始时间戳以支撑逐日对账。</li>\n<li><strong>结算受合规驱动</strong>：FMC 46 CFR Part 541（OSRA 2022 授权，2024-05-26 生效）强约束开票主体、30 日开票/争议/解决时限与发票强制字段。</li>\n<li><strong>豁免是区间集合差</strong>：封装港闭、查验、承运人侧障碍等不可归因窗口，每段带证据引用，才可审计。</li>\n<li><strong>法域驱动模板</strong>：FMC 仅管美国海运 D&amp;D，其他法域走港口规则与合同，系统须支持按法域切换开票与申诉逻辑。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>结算闭环回到运营改进：哪一类异常最常触发滞期、哪个承运商的还箱准时率最低，应反馈到门位分配与预约策略中，形成从计费到预防的回路。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"滞期费与滞留费计算规则及承运商结算","id":"滞期费与滞留费计算规则及承运商结算"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：两个时钟、两类责任方","id":"核心概念-两个时钟-两类责任方"},{"level":2,"text":"免费时长与起止时钟的精确界定","id":"免费时长与起止时钟的精确界定"},{"level":2,"text":"计费引擎：费率阶梯、日历时钟与量化误差","id":"计费引擎-费率阶梯-日历时钟与量化误差"},{"level":2,"text":"承运商结算：对账、争议与发票合规","id":"承运商结算-对账-争议与发票合规"},{"level":2,"text":"异常与豁免：把责任归因写进规则","id":"异常与豁免-把责任归因写进规则"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"堆场绩效指标体系建模：周转、等待、月台利用率与 OTR","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/yard-management-system-dock-door-trailer-appointment/performance-detention-exception-ops/yard-kpi-metrics-model"},"next":{"title":"园区安全、承运商纠纷与合规审计","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/yard-management-system-dock-door-trailer-appointment/performance-detention-exception-ops/yard-safety-dispute-compliance-audit"}}